    <bpmn:process id="W_W677" name="W677. Marketing Budget Management &amp; Spend Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly budget review cycle; campaign spend reporting
Frequency: Monthly budget review; weekly spend tracking during campaigns; annual budget planning
Volume: Annual marketing budget ~PHP 300-500M (~0.5-0.8% of revenue); 15-20 active budget line items
Owner: Marketing Manager
Participants: Digital Marketing Manager, Finance Analyst, VP Marketing
Source: workflow W677 — Marketing Budget Management &amp; Spend Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W677_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W677_Lane1" name="Finance Analyst">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W677_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W677_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W677_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W677_Lane2" name="Marketing Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W677_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W677_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W677_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W677_Task14</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W677_Lane3" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W677_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W677_Lane4" name="VP Marketing">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W677_Task13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W677_End15</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W677_Start6" name="Monthly budget review cycle; campaign spend reporting">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W677_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W677_Task7" name="Finance Analyst allocates annual marketing budget per W26 into monthly and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance Analyst allocates annual marketing budget per W26 into monthly and campaign-level envelopes: media spend, creative production, agency fees, events, sponsorships, loyalty program costs, research — the approved budget loaded into the GL budget organization by marketing cost center × GL account × month with GL budgetary control enabled, so spend can be funds-checked at commitment time
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Marketing Manager
Duration: 2 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W677_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W677_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W677_Task8" name="Marketing Manager distributes budget to campaign owners per approved annual…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Marketing Manager distributes budget to campaign owners per approved annual plan; sets spend thresholds routed by position hierarchy and AME rules, never an ad-hoc name chain — agency POs &gt; PHP 500K and media buys &gt; PHP 1M escalate to VP Marketing
Responsible (R): Marketing Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W677_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W677_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W677_Task9" name="System tracks actual spend against budget in real-time: recurring agency…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System tracks actual spend against budget in real-time: recurring agency retainers and media buys release against blanket POs so the GL budgetary-control funds check fires at requisition and PO approval — commitment accounting, before the invoice lands; media platform invoices, production costs, event expenses, sponsorship payments post against the same envelope; auto-flags line items exceeding 80% of monthly allocation
Responsible (R): System (automated)
Accountable (A): Marketing Manager
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W677_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W677_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W677_Task10" name="Monthly: Marketing Manager reviews budget utilization report with Finance…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Monthly: Marketing Manager reviews budget utilization report with Finance Analyst: total spend vs. budget by line item, spend velocity (projected month-end over/under), variance explanation for material deviations
Responsible (R): Marketing Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 3 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W677_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W677_Flow22</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W677_Task11" name="Finance Analyst reconciles marketing spend to GL accounts: verifies agency…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Finance Analyst reconciles marketing spend to GL accounts: verifies agency invoices against deliverables, matches media invoices to platform reports, allocates shared costs (creative, research) across campaigns
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Marketing Manager
Duration: 1 day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W677_Flow22</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W677_Flow23</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W677_Task12" name="Marketing Manager produces monthly marketing spend dashboard for VP Marketing…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 6: Marketing Manager produces monthly marketing spend dashboard for VP Marketing: spend by channel, cost per acquisition, cost per reach, budget utilization rate, and projected quarter-end spend
Responsible (R): Marketing Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W677_Flow23</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W677_Flow24</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W677_Task13" name="Quarterly: VP Marketing reviews marketing ROI per W565 and budget utilization…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 7: Quarterly: VP Marketing reviews marketing ROI per W565 and budget utilization; approves budget reallocation between channels based on performance data; adjusts Q-spend plans
Responsible (R): VP Marketing
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: 2 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W677_Flow24</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W677_Flow25</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W677_Task14" name="Annual: Marketing Manager develops next-year budget proposal per W26 informed…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 8: Annual: Marketing Manager develops next-year budget proposal per W26 informed by current-year ROI data and strategic priorities per W127
Responsible (R): Marketing Manager
Accountable (A): VP Marketing
Duration: 5 days</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W677_Flow25</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W677_Flow26</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W677_End15" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W677_Flow26</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W677_Annotation16">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-187 (ensure marketing spend &amp; loyalty-fraud control.) | - operational: Marketing Manager review and approval gate; operational: periodic reconciliation against source documents
Owner: Marketing Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W677_Assoc17" sourceRef="W677_Annotation16" targetRef="W677_Start6" associationDirection="None" />
