    <bpmn:process id="W_W1443" name="W1443. Trade Professional WhatsApp Commerce Integration, Contractor Group Management &amp; Digital Engagement" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Trade professional customer onboarding (W24); or monthly trade engagement review; or new WhatsApp Business API feature deployment
Frequency: Continuous messaging (daily); monthly engagement analytics review; quarterly program assessment
Volume: ~5,000 active trade account customers; ~200 WhatsApp contractor groups by region; ~50,000+ messages/month between BuildRight and trade professionals
Owner: Digital Marketing Manager
Participants: Digital Marketing Manager, Trade Account Managers, Store Managers, E-Commerce Content Manager, Category Managers
Source: workflow W1443 — Trade Professional WhatsApp Commerce Integration, Contractor Group Management &amp; Digital Engagement</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W1443_LaneSet5">
        <bpmn:lane id="W1443_Lane1" name="Digital Marketing Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1443_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1443_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1443_Start6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1443_Lane2" name="Trade Account Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1443_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1443_Lane3" name="Store Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1443_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W1443_Lane4" name="System">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1443_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W1443_End12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W1443_Start6" name="Trade professional customer onboarding (W24); or monthly trade engagement review; or new…">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1443_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1443_Task7" name="WhatsApp Business API setup and maintenance">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: WhatsApp Business API setup and maintenance: Digital Marketing Manager configures and maintains: (a) WhatsApp Business API integration with ERP — product catalog sync, order status updates, inventory availability queries, (b) automated greeting and away messages for each regional store number, (c) quick reply templates: &quot;Send me availability of [item]&quot;, &quot;Place repeat order&quot;, &quot;Request project quote&quot;, &quot;Upload delivery photo&quot;, (d) catalog integration: sync top 5,000 trade-relevant SKUs to WhatsApp product catalog with images, specs, trade pricing
Responsible (R): Digital Marketing Manager
Accountable (A): E-Commerce Manager
Duration: Initial: 2 weeks; Maintenance: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1443_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1443_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1443_Task8" name="Trade customer WhatsApp onboarding">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Trade customer WhatsApp onboarding: When a new trade account is approved per W24: (a) Trade Account Manager adds customer to regional WhatsApp broadcast list and contractor group, (b) send welcome message with: trade discount summary, ordering instructions, dedicated store contact, (c) customer can message their regional BuildRight WhatsApp number for: (i) product availability check (system responds with real-time stock), (ii) repeat order from purchase history, (iii) project material list sharing for quote, (iv) delivery scheduling and tracking
Responsible (R): Trade Account Manager
Accountable (A): Digital Marketing Manager
Duration: 10 min per new account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1443_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1443_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1443_Task9" name="Regional contractor group management">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Regional contractor group management: Store Managers or Trade Account Managers moderate regional contractor WhatsApp groups: (a) groups organized by region (Davao contractors, Cebu contractors, Manila contractors) and specialty (electricians, plumbers, general contractors), (b) daily content: (i) product spotlights with trade pricing, (ii) new arrival alerts, (iii) promotional offers exclusive to group members, (iv) how-to tips and industry news, (c) engagement: respond to member questions, facilitate peer-to-peer recommendations (contractors recommending BuildRight products to other contractors), (d) target: 2–3 posts per group per day; respond to inquiries within 30 minutes during business hours
Responsible (R): Store Manager / Trade Account Manager
Accountable (A): Digital Marketing Manager
Duration: 30 min/group/day</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1443_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1443_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W1443_Task10" name="WhatsApp order facilitation">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: WhatsApp order facilitation: When a trade customer requests an order via WhatsApp: (a) system auto-creates a draft order from chat message (NLP extraction of product names and quantities), (b) Trade Account Manager or Store CSR reviews and confirms order details with customer, (c) system applies trade pricing and credit terms, (d) order flows into standard order-to-cash process per W8, (e) customer receives order confirmation and delivery ETA via WhatsApp, (f) delivery tracking updates pushed via WhatsApp (photo of loaded truck, ETA, delivery confirmation photo)
Responsible (R): System / Trade Account Manager
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 10–15 min per order</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1443_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1443_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W1443_Task11" name="Monthly engagement analytics">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Monthly engagement analytics: Digital Marketing Manager compiles WhatsApp engagement report: (a) active trade customers messaging per month, (b) messages sent and received by type (inquiry, order, promotional), (c) order conversion rate from WhatsApp inquiries, (d) revenue attributed to WhatsApp channel, (e) group engagement metrics (posts, reactions, member growth), (f) average response time, (g) present to CMO with recommendations for program improvement
Responsible (R): Digital Marketing Manager
Accountable (A): CMO
Duration: 4 hours/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W1443_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W1443_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W1443_End12" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W1443_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W1443_Annotation13">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-282 (ensure controlled execution — Digital Marketing &amp; Social Media (PA-14.2).) | - operational: Digital Marketing Manager review and approval gate
Owner: Digital Marketing Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
